This directory is reserved for a real Unity project (game/<UnityProjectName>/...).

No Unity project exists here yet: no Unity Editor, license, or build
tooling is available in the environment that bootstrapped this repo
(G0, 2026-09-20). See docs/decisions/0002-unity-unverifiable-in-this-environment.md.

Nothing here is, or should ever be, a fabricated ProjectVersion.txt or
package lock implying the Editor was opened.
